Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Izinkan display TV klinik memutar suara tanpa klik (Chrome policy AutoplayAllowlist).
; Klik dua kali file ini sebagai Administrator, restart Chrome, cek di chrome://policy.
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\AutoplayAllowlist]
"1"="http://192.168.1.127:3886"
